// // ============================================================================
// //  EFFECT.KN — DOWNSTREAM EFFECT MODELING
// //
// //  Model downstream effects, cascading behaviors, and secondary consequences
// //  of the root cause defined in cause.kn.
// //
// //  IMPORTED BY: cause.kn
// //  IMPORTS:      spookymagic.kn (optional, for spooky downstream effects)
// //
// //  PATTERN:
// //    Add helper functions, data types, and effect computations here.
// //    cause.kn calls these to model the full error/edge-case cascade.
// // ============================================================================
//
// use spookymagic
